        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Although `datasets/differential_interfacial_tension_sorting/germ_layer_doublet_specimen.jpg` is vendored on disk, the v1 script never loads, verifies, or segments the zebrafish blastoderm cross-transplantation GFP/RFP fluorescence panels (`render_outputs_v1`, L166-198)." ;
