        pk:evidenceAgainst "2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py L166–L198: render_outputs_v1 renders 3 synthetic panels without loading or segmenting germ_layer_doublet_specimen.jpg <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py#L166-L198>",
